NEARS-3008/NEARS-3035 — bounded regression spot-check: translate()-scoped model read path
post-migration, on the isolated DB (multi_food_db_test_nears_nears_3008_index_cluster, migrated).

app()->setLocale('ar');
Store::whereHas('translations', fn($q) => $q->where('locale','ar'))->first();
  -> store_id=35 name=متجر الاختبار

Item::whereHas('translations', fn($q) => $q->where('locale','ar'))->first();
  -> item_id=95 name=بروكلي

Both models' `translate` global scope correctly resolved Arabic-translated names post-migration
(composite index in place, bare locale index dropped) — confirms the index-drop-and-replace on
`translations` does not break the 30+ consuming models' normal read path.

